# Flooded Strand: {T}, pay 1 life, sacrifice it - search for a Plains or Island card and put it onto the battlefield
# untapped. A Swamp is in the library but is not a Plains or an Island, so it is not offered (the refusal), while the
# Plains is found and enters untapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Flooded Strand
Mountain x6
Swamp
Plains
Island
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Flooded Strand.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Flooded Strand.Activate
! Bot1.Search(Swamp)
Bot1.Search(Plains)

